              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>                                                                                                                 <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">### 2. Autonomous Drug Discovery and Clinical Trial Optimization</span>                                               <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">* **Accelerated Target Identification:** AI platforms reduce drug discovery timelines from years to months by</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
