              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">* **Synthetic Patient Cohorts and Trial Efficiency:** In 2026, clinical trials rely heavily on AI to optimize</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
