              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>                                                                                                                 <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">### 3. Ambient Intelligence and Operational Administrative Automation</span>                                          <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">* **Elimination of Administrative Burden:** Ambient AI scribes listen to clinician-patient interactions in </span>    <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">real-time, automatically updating EHRs, generating clinical documentation, and creating follow-up orders.</span>      <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
