              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">### 4. Hyper-Personalized Preventative Care and Edge AI Monitoring</span>                                             <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">* **Continuous Monitoring via Edge Devices:** On-device AI (Edge AI) processes biometric data locally on </span>      <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">smart wearables, enabling instant detection of anomalies (e.g., cardiac arrhythmias, early septic shock) </span>      <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
