              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">manifestations appear, shifting healthcare models from reactive treatment to proactive prevention.</span>             <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
