              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">### 5. Standardized AI Governance, Explainable AI (XAI), and Regulatory Oversight</span>                              <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">* **Explainable AI (XAI):** Black-box models are increasingly rejected by regulatory bodies (such as the FDA </span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
