              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">algorithmic accountability are enforced, ensuring equitable treatment across diverse patient demographics.</span>     <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
