              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">## Conclusion</span>                                                                                                  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">In 2026, AI is no longer a peripheral technology in healthcare; it is the core operating infrastructure. </span>      <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
